### Global / Normal Colors
background-color={{colors.surface_container.dark.hex}}99
text-color={{colors.on_surface.dark.hex}}
border-color={{colors.on_secondary.dark.hex}}b3
progress-color=over {{colors.on_secondary_container.dark.hex}}

### Critical Urgency Colors
[urgency=critical]
background-color={{colors.on_error.dark.hex}}b3
text-color={{colors.on_error_container.dark.hex}}
border-color={{colors.error_container.dark.hex}}b3
